# shell: desktop
# Q-004/Q-012/Q-015: the Find panel narrows a search to a type, the menu
# offers what the port can actually recognise, and the control is gone in
# formula mode -- where the formula is the question.
note the panel opens with the type control showing everything
key f ctrl
wait 5
expect-find-type All files and folders
note picking Folder narrows it
click 300 400
wait 3
click 200 452
wait 3
expect-find-type Folder
note and a search then finds only things of that type, whatever the name
note asks -- the type is ANDed onto the rows rather than replacing them
click 595 452
wait 30
expect-status results
expect-type-narrowed
quit
